    "statementHTML": "<div class=\"statement-body\">\n<div class=\"statement-section statement-goal\">\n   <h2><span class=\"icon icon-goal\">&nbsp;</span><span>Goal </span></h2>\n   <span class=\"question-statement\">A router receives randomly arriving packets from many users.<br><br>It can transmit up to <var><strong>C</strong></var> packets per time slot and store up to <var><strong>B</strong></var> in a buffer. If arrivals exceed <var><strong>C+B</strong></var>, packets are dropped.<br><br>Find the minimum buffer size <var><strong>B</strong></var> such that packet loss probability is below <var><strong>L</strong></var>, using a probabilistic model and an approximation for rare overload events.</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"statement-section statement-protocol\">\n   <div class=\"blk\">\n      <div class=\"title\">Input</div>\n      <div class=\"question-statement-input\"><strong>Line 1</strong>: Four space-separated numbers<br><br>- <var><strong>n</strong></var>: number of users (integer)<br><br>- <var><strong>lambda_u</strong></var>: average packet generation rate per user (float)<br><br>- <var><strong>C</strong></var>: router transmission capacity (float)<br><br>- <var><strong>L</strong></var>: maximum acceptable packet loss probability (float)</div>\n   </div>\n   <div class=\"blk\">\n      <div class=\"title\">Output</div>\n      <div class=\"question-statement-output\"><strong>Line 1:</strong><br>The minimum integer buffer size <var><strong>B</strong></var> (integer)</div>\n   </div>\n   <div class=\"blk\">\n      <div class=\"title\">Constraints</div>\n      <div class=\"question-statement-constraints\">1 &le; <var><strong>n</strong></var> &le; <const>1000</const><br><br>0 &lt; <var><strong>lambda_u</strong></var> &lt; <const>10</const><br><br>1 &le; <var><strong>C</strong></var> &le; <const>1000</const><br><br>0 &lt; <var><strong>L</strong></var> &lt; <const>1</const></div>\n   </div>\n   <div class=\"blk\">\n      <div class=\"title\">Example</div>\n     